#~ msgid "NeoChat"
#~ msgstr "NeoChat"

#~ msgid "A client for matrix, the decentralized communication protocol"
#~ msgstr "Un cliente de Matrix, li protocol de communication decentralisat"

#, fuzzy
#~| msgid ""
#~| "NeoChat is a Matrix client. It allows you to send text messages, videos "
#~| "and audio files to your family, colleagues and friends using the Matrix "
#~| "protocol."
#~ msgid ""
#~ "NeoChat is a client for Matrix, the decentralized communication protocol "
#~ "for instant messaging. It allows you to send text messages, videos and "
#~ "audio files to your family, colleagues and friends. It uses KDE "
#~ "frameworks and most notably Kirigami to provide a convergent experience "
#~ "across multiple platforms."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "NeoChat es un cliente de Matrix. On posse usar it por inviar missages "
#~ "textual, video- e audiofiles a su familie, colegos e amics med li "
#~ "protocol Matrix."

#~ msgid "The KDE Community"
#~ msgstr "Li comunité de KDE"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Matrix is a decentralized communication protocol, putting the user back "
#~ "in control. Currently NeoChat implements large part of the protocol with "
#~ "the exception of encrypted chats and video chat."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Matrix es un decentralisat protocol de communication quel retroda li "
#~ "control a un usator. Actualmen, NeoChat implementa un grand parte del "
#~ "protocol except ciffrat conversationes e videotelefonada."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "NeoChat works both on mobile and desktop while providing a consistent "
#~ "user experience."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "NeoChat supporta amb computatores e aparates mobil, ancor providente un "
#~ "consistent experientie de usator."
